{
  "name": "GD·08 CRM · Ops Agent (Monday)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·08 CRM Ops Agent (Boss 5 · D6b, 5.9 Card 6)\nMondays 07:00. The agent can READ anything (search companies, contacts and deals; pipeline) and has ONE write tool, propose_change, which only adds a row to Supabase crm_proposals. It ends with a five-line health report that starts with what last week's changes achieved.\nCode then checks every proposal against the allow-list; off-list proposals are rejected before Tolu sees them. Tolu approves or rejects each on Telegram. Nothing changes until the executor (separate workflow) runs approved rows.\n\nTable: crm_proposals(id serial, action, target_ids jsonb, details jsonb, evidence text, expected_effect text, reversible bool, status default 'proposed', created_at default now(), decided_at, before_values jsonb, result jsonb, executed_at).\n**Credentials:** HubSpot App Token (read scopes are enough here), Supabase API (for propose_change), Postgres, OpenAI, Telegram.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SUPABASE_PROJECT, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "dfd13971-2a7c-46a2-b449-5b4317970b43",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -432
      ]
    },
